The 3rd season of the Russian QuakeWorld Leguee began in late 2003 and ended in early 2004. It was one of the few seasons that allowed non-Russian speaking teams. One of these teams became the winner - FS. Russians Black Spiny, Zvery and SuperHeroes were the competition.
